      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Owed by the elder Ab\u016b Sa\u02bfd the parn\u0101s, b. \u1e24\u0101tim to the Estate</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;of the Jerusalemites: from the beginning of Rab\u012b\u02bf al-\u0101khir of the year&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;546 of the Arab dating, corresponding to&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;(the beginning) of Av of the year 1462 of the documents&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;118 dirhems a month. He also owes the balance of</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. that he took upon himself by his agreement&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . he recognized . . .. Its sum being&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;110 dir.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.... the parn\u0101s Ab\u016b Sa\u02bfd ....&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.... 110 dir. ....&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>. . .Ab\u016b \u02bel-Khayr the parn\u0101s the 110 dir...&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;as was established above and recognized by him . ...&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Jacob b. R. Abraham, of blessed memory. Ephraim b. R. Meshull\u0101m.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Nathan b. R. Samuel (the \u1e25\u0101v\u0113r, of blessed memory).</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
